n              - generic [ref=e268]:\n                - generic [ref=e270]:\n                  - link \"买股票的老木匠\" [ref=e271] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /3058599833\n                  - link \"5小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e272] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /3058599833/379061114\n                - generic [ref=e275]:\n                  - text: 从2008年开始，美股的每一次调整，最终都涨回来了，并且很快就创出了新高，这其实给人一种强烈的暗示，就是美股的调整都不可怕，因为美国不会允许股价长期下跌。当然，原因都被说过多次了，无非就是美国家庭财产配置，养老金都在股市，还有就是选票等等。然而，并没有谁规定美股不能跌，美国法律和...\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e276] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e277]:\n                  - link \" 7\" [ref=e278] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e279]: \n                    - generic [ref=e280]: \"7\"\n                  - link \" 193\" [ref=e281] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e282]: \n                    - generic [ref=e283]: \"193\"\n                  - link \" 498\" [ref=e284] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e285]: \n                    - generic [ref=e286]: \"498\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e287] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e288]: \n                    - generic [ref=e289]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e290]:\n              - link [ref=e291] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /cozone\n                - img [ref=e292]\n              - generic [ref=e293]:\n                - generic [ref=e295]:\n                  - link \"柯中\" [ref=e296] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /cozone\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e297]\n                  - link \"4小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e298] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /5243796549/379082944\n                - generic [ref=e301]:\n                  - generic [ref=e302]:\n                    - text: 瑞银昨天开了个简短的电话会议，再次全面上调碳酸锂价格中枢到25万元每吨。\n                    - text: 核心逻辑就是我们周末发的那个文章类似的预期差：这一轮市场可能超市场预期\n                    - text: 供应端这块：\n                    - text: 1、今年供应大概在197.5万吨，明年到241.7万吨（同比22%）\n                    - text: 2、市场预测都是偏乐观，没有考虑爬坡，jxw复产延迟，...\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e303] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e304]:\n                  - link \" 7\" [ref=e305] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e306]: \n                    - generic [ref=e307]: \"7\"\n                  - link \" 220\" [ref=e308] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e309]: \n                    - generic [ref=e310]: \"220\"\n                  - link \" 344\" [ref=e311] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e312]: \n                    - generic [ref=e313]: \"344\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e314] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e315]: \n                    - generic [ref=e316]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e317]:\n              - link [ref=e318] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /xiaofeng1983\n                - img [ref=e319]\n              - generic [ref=e320]:\n                - generic [ref=e322]:\n                  - link \"张小丰\" [ref=e323] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /xiaofeng1983\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e324]\n                  - img \"达人认证\" [ref=e325]\n                  - link \"5小时前· 来自雪球\" [ref=e326] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /9518372158/379058709\n                - generic [ref=e327]:\n                  - generic [ref=e329]:\n                    - generic [ref=e330]:\n                      - text: 回复\n                      - link \"@你敢下重注吗\" [ref=e331] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://xueqiu.com/n/你敢下重注吗\n                      - text: \": 我只是说智驾水平达到了另一个层级。简单来讲但凡真正体验过各个品牌城区智驾的人都会达成一共识：目前小鹏领先幅度实在是太大，不是强一点，是达到了另一个层级。\"\n                      - text: 而且我预计因为选择了正确的技术路线，小鹏未来1年智驾进步速度还会非常惊人，其他企业如果不改底层技术推...\n                    - link \"展开\" [ref=e332] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: \"\"\n                  - blockquote [ref=e333] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - link \"@张小丰 荣誉认证 达人认证 ：\" [ref=e335]:\n                      - /url: /xiaofeng1983\n                      - generic [ref=e336]: \"@张小丰\"\n                      - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e337]\n                      - img \"达人认证\" [ref=e338]\n                      - generic [ref=e339]: ：\n                    - generic [ref=e342]:\n                      - text: 试驾了小鹏的vla2.0智驾。一句话：真正的遥遥领先，就是懂交规的FSD。秒杀其他一切国产智驾。。。\n                      - text: 注1：其他智驾我都试过。\n                      - text: 注2：不持有小鹏股票，和投资无关。只是给大家提供一些信息。感兴趣的可以自己去试试。\n                    - generic [ref=e343]:\n                      - text: 昨天 14:29 · 转发 7\n                      - link \"· 讨论 408\" [ref=e344]:\n                        - /url: /9518372158/378962154#comment\n                      - text: · 赞 161\n                - generic [ref=e345]:\n                  - link \" 2\" [ref=e346] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e347]: \n                    - generic [ref=e348]: \"2\"\n                  - link \" 115\" [ref=e349] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e350]: \n                    - generic [ref=e351]: \"115\"\n                  - link \" 117\" [ref=e352] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e353]: \n                    - generic [ref=e354]: \"117\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e355] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e356]: \n                    - generic [ref=e357]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e358]:\n              - link [ref=e359] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /3045778209\n                - img [ref=e360]\n              - generic [ref=e361]:\n                - generic [ref=e363]:\n                  - link \"大黄蚬子hgx\" [ref=e364] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /3045778209\n                  - link \"修改于3小时前· 来自Android\" [ref=e365] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /3045778209/379098966\n                - generic [ref=e366]:\n                  - generic [ref=e368]:\n                    - generic [ref=e369]:\n                      - text: 回复\n                      - link \"@本金分红复投倍增\" [ref=e370] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://xueqiu.com/n/本金分红复投倍增\n                      - text: \": 我知道这是一个大家公认的广为流传的数据，我只有一个小好奇，那就是如果30年年化66%，最终收益率大概是200万倍（大概啊我数学不好估算的），就算他的基金开始的时候只有一个亿规模，到最后就算去掉分红和管理费，最终规模也不会少于150万亿美元，再少算些，100万亿美元的...\"\n                    - link \"展开\" [ref=e371] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: \"\"\n                  - blockquote [ref=e372] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - link \"@大黄蚬子hgx ：\" [ref=e374]:\n                      - /url: /3045778209\n                      - generic [ref=e375]: \"@大黄蚬子hgx\"\n                      - generic [ref=e376]: ：\n                    - generic [ref=e377]:\n                      - generic [ref=e378]:\n                        - generic [ref=e379]:\n                          - link \"$京东方A(SZ000725)$\" [ref=e380]:\n                            - /url: https://xueqiu.com/S/SZ000725\n                          - link \"$TCL科技(SZ000100)$\" [ref=e381]:\n                            - /url: https://xueqiu.com/S/SZ000100\n                          - text: 看好面板行业的几个朋友，\n                          - link \"@伊夫圣洛朗\" [ref=e382]:\n                            - /url: https://xueqiu.com/n/伊夫圣洛朗\n                          - text: 买的tcl，我选的京东方，\n                          - link \"@飞翔芸\" [ref=e383]:\n                            - /url: https://xueqiu.com/n/飞翔芸\n                          - text: 一样买一半，我们都有美好的未来\n                          - img \"[捂脸]\" [ref=e384]\n                          - text: 绝大多数人不喜欢面板显示器行业，包括很多大v和基金经理，原因包括但不限于重资产高投资，强周期高折旧，利润低技术迭代快，盘子大散户...\n                        - link \"展开\" [ref=e385]:\n                          - /url: \"\"\n                      - blockquote [ref=e386]:\n                        - list [ref=e388]:\n                          - listitem [ref=e389]:\n                            - link [ref=e390]:\n                              - /url: javascript:;\n                              - img [ref=e391]\n                          - listitem [ref=e392]:\n                            - link [ref=e393]:\n                              - /url: javascript:;\n                              - img [ref=e394]\n                          - listitem [ref=e395]:\n                            - link [ref=e396]:\n                              - /url: javascript:;\n                              - img [ref=e397]\n                          - listitem [ref=e398]:\n                            - link [ref=e399]:\n                              - /url: javascript:;\n                              - img [ref=e400]\n                          - listitem [ref=e401]:\n                            - link [ref=e402]:\n                              - /url: javascript:;\n                              - img [ref=e403]\n                          - listitem [ref=e404]:\n                            - link [ref=e405]:\n                              - /url: javascript:;\n                              - img [ref=e406]\n                    - generic [ref=e407]:\n                      - text: 02-27 20:48 · 转发 31\n                      - link \"· 讨论 883\" [ref=e408]:\n                        - /url: /3045778209/377302433#comment\n                      - text: · 赞 1338\n                - generic [ref=e409]:\n                  - link \" 转发\" [ref=e410] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: