- generic [ref=e474]: \"170\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e475] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e476]: \n                    - generic [ref=e477]: 收藏\n            - article [ref=e478]:\n              - link [ref=e479] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /7808414143\n                - img [ref=e480]\n              - generic [ref=e481]:\n                - generic [ref=e483]:\n                  - link \"建idea\" [ref=e484] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /7808414143\n                  - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e485]\n                  - img \"实盘认证\" [ref=e486]\n                  - link \"8小时前· 来自Android\" [ref=e487] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /7808414143/379046865\n                - generic [ref=e490]:\n                  - generic [ref=e491]:\n                    - text: 我为什么总是劝普通人远离股票市场，而不是教导他们进行价值投资？\n                    - text: 因为普通人根本没有大额现金对股票进行长线持有。\n                    - text: 招商银行50万以上存款的比例不到2%，而招行已经是国内做私行客户业务最好的银行之一了，普遍客户质量更高。其他银行只会更低。\n                    - text: 实际上根据央行的调研数据，中国超过5...\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e492] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e493]:\n                  - link \" 转发\" [ref=e494] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e495]: \n                    - generic [ref=e496]: 转发\n                  - link \" 65\" [ref=e497] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e498]: \n                    - generic [ref=e499]: \"65\"\n                  - link \" 94\" [ref=e500] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e501]: \n                    - generic [ref=e502]: \"94\"\n                  - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e503] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                    - generic [ref=e504]: \n                    - generic [ref=