[cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: http://xueqiu.com/about/mobile-xueqiu\n            - text: ·\n            - generic [ref=e102]: 中国香港\n          - generic [ref=e103] [cursor=pointer]: 关注\n        - article [ref=e104]:\n          - heading \"煤炭供给\" [level=1] [ref=e105]\n          - generic [ref=e106]:\n            - text: 来自\n            - link \"爱投资的小人书的雪球专栏\" [ref=e107] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /7103876041/column\n          - generic [ref=e108]:\n            - paragraph [ref=e109]:\n              - text: 我这两天发的贴对应煤炭供给会比公布数字大一些\n              - generic [ref=e110]: 。\n            - paragraph [ref=e111]:\n              - text: 券商一直认为煤炭产能按照国家计划\n              - generic [ref=e113]: ，\n              - text: 供给不大\n              - generic [ref=e114]: 。\n            - paragraph [ref=e115]:\n              - text: 我以准旗举例\n              - generic [ref=e117]: ，\n              - text: 准旗60多座停产煤矿\n              - generic [ref=e119]: ，\n              - text: 最终的结果不是复产\n              - generic [ref=e121]: ，\n              - text: 而是指标整合\n              - generic [ref=e122]: 。\n            - paragraph [ref=e123]:\n              - text: 最近的龙王沟核增等等\n              - generic [ref=e125]: ，\n              - text: 实际利用的就是准旗的停产煤矿指标\n              - generic [ref=e126]: 。\n            - paragraph [ref=e127]:\n              - text: 这个对应什么数字呢\n              - generic [ref=e128]: ？\n            - paragraph [ref=e129]:\n              - text: 就是公布的什么内蒙煤矿产能利用率长期在90以下\n              - generic [ref=e131]: ，\n              - text: 核心原因不是煤矿不满产\n              - generic [ref=e133]: ，\n              - text: 是有几十个停产煤矿\n              - generic [ref=e134]: 。\n            - paragraph [ref=e135]:\n              - text: 我一直预期煤价会有超预期下跌行情\n              - generic [ref=e137]: ，\n              - text: 煤价会长期无限接近发改委指引区间下沿\n              - generic [ref=e138]: 。\n            - paragraph [ref=e139]:\n              - text: 这就是主要原因\n              - generic [ref=e140]: 。\n            - paragraph [ref=e141]:\n              - text: 这相当于一块潜在增产表外产能\n              - generic [ref=e142]: 。\n            - paragraph [ref=e143]:\n              - text: 虽然发改委增产指标不多\n              - generic [ref=e144]: 。\n            - paragraph [ref=e145]:\n              - text: 但是这部分转为士产\n              - generic [ref=e147]: ，\n              - text: 大致比发改委公布数字多一倍多\n              - generic [ref=e148]: 。\n        - paragraph [ref=e149]: 风险提示：用户发表的所有文章仅代表个人观点，与雪球的立场无关。投资决策需建立在独立思考之上。\n        - generic [ref=e150]:\n          - link \"爱投资的小人书的专栏 1096篇文章 · 17284人关注 \" [ref=e151] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /7103876041/column\n            - generic [ref=e152]:\n              - generic [ref=e153]:\n                - generic [ref=e154]:\n                  - img [ref=e155]\n                  - generic [ref=e156]: 爱投资的小人书的专栏\n                - generic [ref=e157]: 1096篇文章 · 17284人关注\n              - generic [ref=e158]: \n          - generic [ref=e160]:\n            - generic [ref=e161] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e162]: \n              - generic [ref=e164]: \"25\"\n            - generic [ref=e165] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic [ref=e166]: \n              - generic [ref=e168]: \"3\"\n        - generic [ref=e170]:\n          - img \"微信分享\" [ref=e174] [cursor=pointer]\n          - generic [ref=e175]:\n            - link \" 转发\" [ref=e176] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"#\"\n              - generic [ref=e177]: \n              - paragraph [ref=e178]: 转发\n            - link \" 1\" [ref=e179] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"#\"\n              - generic [ref=e180]: \n              - paragraph [ref=e181]: \"1\"\n          - link \"投诉\" [ref=e184] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"\"\n            - paragraph [ref=e185]: 投诉\n        - generic [ref=e187]:\n          - generic [ref=e188]:\n            - img [ref=e189]\n            - generic [ref=e190]:\n              - generic [ref=e191]:\n                - generic [ref=e192]: 回复@